cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AtlasAI, please cite the preprint listed under preferred-citation."
title: "AtlasAI"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Emre040/AtlasAI"
url: "https://atlas-ai-livid.vercel.app"
abstract: "AtlasAI is the natural-language research assistant of the Human Protein Atlas: specialised agents for search, gene investigation, dictionary lookups and inclusion checks, and an orchestrator that runs multi-step studies over the HPA data release, keeping every intermediate result as an artifact with provenance."
